assign isSurfacePaved surface=paved|asphalt|concrete|paving_stones|grass_paver|sett|cobblestone|metal|wood
assign isSurfaceSmoothUnpaved or surface=compacted|fine_gravel tracktype=grade1|grade2 # this is unpaved but not so bad...
assign isSurfaceUnpaved surface=unpaved|compacted|fine_gravel|gravel|pebblestone|ground|dirt|earth|grass|mud|sand
assign isUnknown and not isSurfacePaved not isSurfaceUnpaved

assign isPavedByDefault highway=primary|primary_link|secondary|secondary_link|tertiary|tertiary_link|cycleway|rest_area|pedestrian|residential|living_street|service|residential

assign isPaved or isSurfacePaved and isUnknown isPavedByDefault
assign isSmoothUnpaved isSurfaceSmoothUnpaved
assign isUnpaved not isPaved
